{"title":"writing my cafe dream piece","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/writing-my-cafe-dream","date":1742310000000,"content":" \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4a1ec512-4c3f-44be-bd18-51c7ecd5e571/writing_my_cafe_dream%E2%80%943.18.25.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"2048\" height=\"2048\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4a1ec512-4c3f-44be-bd18-51c7ecd5e571/writing_my_cafe_dream%E2%80%943.18.25.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4a1ec512-4c3f-44be-bd18-51c7ecd5e571/writing_my_cafe_dream%E2%80%943.18.25.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4a1ec512-4c3f-44be-bd18-51c7ecd5e571/writing_my_cafe_dream%E2%80%943.18.25.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4a1ec512-4c3f-44be-bd18-51c7ecd5e571/writing_my_cafe_dream%E2%80%943.18.25.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4a1ec512-4c3f-44be-bd18-51c7ecd5e571/writing_my_cafe_dream%E2%80%943.18.25.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4a1ec512-4c3f-44be-bd18-51c7ecd5e571/writing_my_cafe_dream%E2%80%943.18.25.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4a1ec512-4c3f-44be-bd18-51c7ecd5e571/writing_my_cafe_dream%E2%80%943.18.25.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p><em>this is my </em><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/visual-diaries\"><em>visual diaries</em></a><em>, in which I synthesize my week through my hands, and inner vision.</em></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr /> \n\n\n  <p><strong><em>wednesday, february 26, 2025 — 5pm</em></strong><em> </em></p><p><em>after weeks of delay, I finish writing a 10,837 word story, “</em><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/my-cafe-dream-loss-grief-and-gifts\" target=\"_blank\"><em>my cafe dream, loss, grief, and gifts</em></a><em>” — and by the last paragraph, I feel like my body is on fire, like I’ve transformed terror into beauty, grief into gold. my card of the week is the sun — and in that moment, I can feel the sun burning through me.</em> </p><p><br />*</p><p></p><p>I watched Spider-Man <a href=\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt9362722/\" target=\"_blank\">Across the Spider-Verse</a> and <a href=\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt4633694/\" target=\"_blank\">Into the Spiderverse</a> this past weekend, and it must have seeped into my subconscious, because the color scheme that emerged here feels a bit… comic book dynamism, which I was really into. I can feel my visual style evolving as I do these weekly diaries — without any intention to. </p><p></p><h1>the first sketch</h1>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8ac2a8e5-6aad-443f-8821-156d6c164fce/Screenshot+2025-03-18+at+4.58.19%E2%80%AFPM.png?format=1000w\" width=\"2140\" height=\"2106\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8ac2a8e5-6aad-443f-8821-156d6c164fce/Screenshot+2025-03-18+at+4.58.19%E2%80%AFPM.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8ac2a8e5-6aad-443f-8821-156d6c164fce/Screenshot+2025-03-18+at+4.58.19%E2%80%AFPM.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8ac2a8e5-6aad-443f-8821-156d6c164fce/Screenshot+2025-03-18+at+4.58.19%E2%80%AFPM.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8ac2a8e5-6aad-443f-8821-156d6c164fce/Screenshot+2025-03-18+at+4.58.19%E2%80%AFPM.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8ac2a8e5-6aad-443f-8821-156d6c164fce/Screenshot+2025-03-18+at+4.58.19%E2%80%AFPM.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8ac2a8e5-6aad-443f-8821-156d6c164fce/Screenshot+2025-03-18+at+4.58.19%E2%80%AFPM.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8ac2a8e5-6aad-443f-8821-156d6c164fce/Screenshot+2025-03-18+at+4.58.19%E2%80%AFPM.png?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <h1>process notes</h1><p><br />this one felt very puzzle-like — in that, when I started, it was going a totally, completely different direction for a good 45 minutes — a direction which felt “safe” and “easy” but not quite right. then, in the last 15 minutes, I discovered that I much preferred the all-red fire. it felt more intense and dark and transformative, which was the experience of writing this piece. </p><p>I added some blue around the fire, and then I was done.  </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/ed453720-a734-480c-8794-e03397ce80f0/writing_my_cafe_dream-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=1000w\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/ed453720-a734-480c-8794-e03397ce80f0/writing_my_cafe_dream-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/ed453720-a734-480c-8794-e03397ce80f0/writing_my_cafe_dream-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/ed453720-a734-480c-8794-e03397ce80f0/writing_my_cafe_dream-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/ed453720-a734-480c-8794-e03397ce80f0/writing_my_cafe_dream-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/ed453720-a734-480c-8794-e03397ce80f0/writing_my_cafe_dream-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/ed453720-a734-480c-8794-e03397ce80f0/writing_my_cafe_dream-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/ed453720-a734-480c-8794-e03397ce80f0/writing_my_cafe_dream-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n<hr />  \n\n\n  <p>🌸 more <a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/